# Language / stack topics for tmux-cht.sh (ctrl+a i).
# One topic per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Two kinds of entries live here:
#   1. topics cht.sh has a real cheat sheet for  -> instant, cached for a week
#   2. topics cht.sh does not cover yet          -> answered by the free-model
#      fallback in the script, so roughly 10s instead of 0.2s
#
# Quick existence check for a new entry:
#   curl -s "cht.sh/<topic>" | head -1     # prints "# <topic>" when the sheet exists
# (a 404 on "cht.sh/<topic>/<query>" means only that one question is missing,
#  not that the topic is absent - the script retries the other URL shape)

